379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 173 0 R
/E (Prior to PSI, I was really interested in biology, but I had almost no experience with research. Through PSI's weekly lectures, I got the chance to learn about so many areas of research I did not know existed. My favorite part of the experience was being given the opportunity to do a summer internship at OHSU. I was really surprised to find that I actually started to enjoy the computational side even more than the wet lab side over the course of the summer, and that I love coding and analyzing data! Whereas beforehand I wanted to go into wet lab biomedical research, I am now really interested in pursuing computational biology research.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
